#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:4
#: 3e299dc504e44f41862f68eb6a0ec468
msgid "Speed to fly"
msgstr "飞行速度"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:7
#: ec68233d17f7483e846db0172f911c0e
msgid "Airspeed Management (Optional)"
msgstr "空速管理（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:9
#: c46e63f906e549738f40b692fc358ed0
msgid ""
"It is also possible to let soaring control the airspeed in certain "
"situations."
msgstr "也可以在某些情况下让热升气流飞行控制空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:11
#: ade6992f50e94f5a916d6af4049fd171
msgid ""
"In THERMAL mode, the parameter :ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` sets "
"the target airspeed in metres per second."
msgstr ""
"在 THERMAL 模式下，参数 :ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` 设置目标空速（单位：米/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:13
#: 8409242c5186439b96a9a856f698c312
msgid ""
"In AUTO, FBWB and CRUISE modes, the parameter "
":ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` controls the target airspeed when "
"the aircraft is gliding."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO、FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式下，参数 :ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` "
"控制飞机滑翔时的目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:15
#: b65cb5c928f94741b86a5bbe9ea0f94a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` to a positive number in metres "
"per second to use this as the constant target airspeed."
msgstr "将 :ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` 设为正数（单位：米/秒）以使用该值作为恒定目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:17
#: 9aeafad34dea437aa32c8834aa4570be
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` to -1 to automatically calculate"
" the best airspeed based on speed-to-fly theory. The best airspeed is based "
"on current estimated lift/sink, headwind and the setting of "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`. See the below talk for more information."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` 设为 -1 "
"以根据飞行速度理论自动计算最佳空速。最佳空速基于当前估计的上升/下沉速率、顶风以及 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` "
"的设置。更多信息请参见下方讲座。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-speed-to-fly.rst:19
#: 59e489a6a39a4ebbaea136fbf64a5bb9
msgid ""
"If one or the other of the above parameters are zero, or when the aircraft "
"is using power (throttle > 0), :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` is "
"used in the corresponding flight modes as usual."
msgstr ""
"若上述任一参数为零，或当飞机使用动力时（油门 > 0），则在相应飞行模式下照常使用 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`。"
